# Tradovate trading-session ingestion — template
#
# Copy this file to trading-days.csv (same directory) and fill in real values.
# The generator reads trading-days.csv at regen time; the .example file is
# ignored. Columns: date,hours,note (note optional). Header row optional.
#
#   date   — ISO YYYY-MM-DD of the session (one row per day)
#   hours  — hours on the charts that day (decimal, e.g. 6.0)
#   note   — short context (optional; e.g. "ES session", "combine eval")
#
# Once trading-days.csv exists, the heatmap flips the green marker from a
# hollow ring (placeholder scheduled session) to a SOLID DOT (verified
# session carrying real hours). Regen: python3 build_vocational_log.py
# --since 2026-01-01
#
# REPLACE the lines below with your own Tradovate-derived data. These are
# PLACEHOLDER rows showing the format only — not real sessions.
date,hours,note
2026-01-05,6.0,placeholder — replace with real Tradovate session
2026-01-06,5.5,placeholder — replace with real Tradovate session
